cans in Brazil and their influence on our culture. The collection includes emotionally moving objects and documents."],["Museu de Arte Moderna","sight",-23.588,-46.6554,"Alameda do Café","Temporarily closed for reforms","","","","r","With excellent exhibits, a varied schedule of independent movies and a boutique restaurant."],["Obelisco de São Paulo","sight",-23.5848,-46.6548,"Complexo Viário Ayrton Senna","daily 10:00-16:00","","","","r","The 72m-high mausoleum contains the remnants of 4 students and 713 combatants who perished during Revolução Constitucionalista de 32, a 1932 uprising of São Paulo against the dictatorial federal government."],["Oca","sight",-23.5868,-46.6554,"Trilha 6km","Tue-Sun: 10:00-17:00","","","","r","An exposition center that looks like a flying saucer, designed by architect Oscar Niemeyer. Exhibits outstanding temporary shows."],["Auditório Ibirapuera","activity",-23.5856,-46.6565,"Complexo Viário Ayrton Senna","Fri Sat 13:00-22:00; Sun 13:00-20:00","","","","r","A building that was foreseen in the original project of Oscar Niemeyer in 1954. Conceived for musical presentations, its 20-meter back door, when opened, allows it to cater for about 20,000 people."],["Cinemateca Brasileira","activity",-23.5919,-46.646,"Largo Senador Raul Cardoso, 207","daily 08:00-18:00","","","","r","The most extensive archive of Brazilian cinema, this movie theater shows cult and national filmmaking, with some screenings in open areas. The beautiful brick building is also worth a visit."],["Rancho da Empada","restaurant",-23.594,-46.6414,"R. Sena Madureira, 557","Mon-Sat 08:45-11:00; Sun 09:00-22:00","","","","r","Sells many different empadas (mini pies with crumbly dough), alongside other snacks. Larger pies can be bought, but some have to be requested in advance."],["Bráz Quintal","restaurant",-23.5919,-46.6435,"R. Gandavo, 447","Mon-Thu 18:30-23:30; Fri Sat 18:00-00:00; Sun 18:00-23:30","","","","r","High-end pizza, closer to Italian than Brazilian-style. The garden decoration stands out, and there's an extensive drink menu."]]}